flowchart TD
    A[Request arrives at the edge] --> B{Cached response?}
    B -- yes --> C[Serve from cache]
    B -- no --> D[Authenticate the caller]
    D --> E{Token valid?}
    E -- no --> F[Reply 401 Unauthorized]
    E -- yes --> G[Load the tenant settings]
    G --> H{Feature flag on?}
    H -- no --> I[Legacy handler]
    H -- yes --> J[New handler]
    I --> K[Query the primary database]
    J --> L[Query the read replica]
    K --> M[Map rows to the response model]
    L --> M
    M --> N{Payload over 1 MB?}
    N -- yes --> O[Stream the response in chunks]
    N -- no --> P[Send the response in one piece]
    O --> Q[Write the access log]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[Emit metrics to the collector]
    R --> S{Error rate above threshold?}
    S -- yes --> T[Page the on-call engineer]
    S -- no --> U[Done]
    T --> U
    C --> Q
    F --> Q
    U --> V[Archive the trace after 7 days]
    V --> W[Purge the cache entry]
    W --> X[End]
